<title>USA: Nassau Cty, N.Y.,$3.205 mln won by Roosevelt&amp;Cross.</title>
<headline>Nassau Cty, N.Y.,$3.205 mln won by Roosevelt&amp;Cross.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt &amp; Cross said it won $3.205 million of Nassau Cty, N.Y., combined sewer districts bonds, Series Y, with a net interest cost of 5.00 percent.</p>
</text>
